  "sourceData": {
    "answer": "to: make-merry/be-festive",
    "mnemonic": "<ja>浮く</ja> means \"to float,\" and <ja>浮かれる</ja> draws on that metaphor of \"floating\" to mean <vocabulary>to be happy</vocabulary>, <vocabulary>to be in high spirits</vocabulary>, or <vocabulary>to be elated</vocabulary>. We have the same metaphor in English — think of being \"on cloud nine.\" ",
    "readingMnemonic": "The reading comes from <ja>浮く</ja>, so if you know that you' are going <vocabulary>to be happy</vocabulary> and you won't have a <reading>care</reading> (<ja>かれる</ja>) in the world!",
